{"server":"cn","storyId":"act10mini_level_act10mini_st02","groupId":"act10mini","stageId":null,"title":"我如浮萍","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act10mini/level_act10mini_st02.txt","sourceHash":"6d0c6f062cd904a5524b6143952bf39af575177bea26a5323105f99a0cb220d8","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"义贼夜烟偶然听到秘密消息，逃跑时连累一家店铺被烧。夜烟劝下想轻生的苏茜，却因为矿石病发作而昏迷。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"1097年11月19日 9:20 P.M."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保安A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"走这边。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保安A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"前面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保安A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"还在前面，我好像看见她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保安A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，这块路牌，我们刚才是不是见过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保安B","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"我们回到原地了，我是说，又回到原地了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保安B","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"那我说对了，那个菲林的源石技艺肯定有鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保安A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"先别急，前面就是感染者社区了，那个小贼肯定就躲在里面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保安A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"该死的感染者......今天就是把这里掀个底朝天也要把那个贼揪出来，看谁敢拦我们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保安队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保安A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"头儿，就这么放过她，那些钱和东西就不管了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保安队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"算了算了，统共就那么点东西，这点钱大家凑一凑垫上吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保安队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷反复交代过，绝对不许多生事端。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保安队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"谁要是给老爷惹了不必要的麻烦，那就不只是开除的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保安队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"先撤吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"]"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想要抓住猫猫的话，得再聪明一点才行哦~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小敏，你在吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女巫姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给，今天的饭和药。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，慢点吃，别噎到了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"一块干面包，一顿充饥的饭。\n我是什么时候开始施舍他人的呢？\n明明自己的生活已经难以为继了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐你......脸色好差哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗......有那么明显吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女巫姐姐，我什么时候也能像你一样使用源石技艺啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在还不可以哦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......可是我也想变成女巫，像你那样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你再长大一点吧，小猫猫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"刺痛。\n矿石病病灶的刺痛从三个月前起就再也没有停止过。\n也许自己也该离开这个地方了。\n结晶粉尘化的时候，误伤到别人可不好。\n不，对于一只优雅的猫来说，对于一个巫女林的术师来说——\n离开这个世界的时候，也必须是孤独而优雅的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一家、两家、三家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"七只、八只、九只......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你猜猜，这片感染者区里，一共有几家酒馆，几只流浪猫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我数得很清楚喔，一共有八家酒馆，三十二只流浪猫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每家酒馆可以分到四只猫咪，每只猫咪都可以分到新鲜的鳞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有没有算过，自己已经走过了多少个城市，去过几个感染者聚集区？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得，是五个城市，八个感染者聚集区，十七次越狱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走过这么多城市，卡拉顿城算得上是相当有趣的一个地方了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都是一样，天亮了就去赚钱，天黑了就去喝酒。眼睛闭上的时候就绝不会为第二天的事担忧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者，普通人，又有什么区别呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定哪一天，“轰隆”一声，整个卡拉顿港区全部掉进海里，就全都结束啦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，如果要挑一个葬身之地的话，这倒是个不错的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在一个可以俯视整个卡拉顿城的地方，全身变成一整块石头，然后，“嘭”的一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么都不留下，谁也不知道——但还是要找个远些的地方，免得粉尘随风飘过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身体里的那些石头似乎平静下来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来还不是时候，至少不是今天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那一天来临之前，还是要先考虑一下明天该上哪玩才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀，不知不觉，天都已经亮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早安，维多利亚，早上好，卡拉顿城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么今天，哪户幸运人家会受到猫猫的眷顾呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"1097年11月23日 10:14 P.M."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这边的建筑物，一直没有人住啊......是因为靠近废弃城区吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"旧仓库......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定有什么能用的东西呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"进去看看吧~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食物......这种地方也不会有食物吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"会有什么值钱的东西吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好多灰尘，难闻的机油味，也没有什么可爱的东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个花瓶倒是挺漂亮——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别乱动那些东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（？！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就不明白了，不就是绑架几个感染者和一个老头子吗，至于这么兴师动众的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴，拿钱办事，多的别问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呼......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......武器清点好了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没问题，对付那个糟老头子议员可太绰绰有余了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（武器？议员？无聊的东西......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还是不能大意，我可不太相信那几个雇来的打手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爆炸物呢？那些源石炸弹我们不用管了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爆炸物的事情有其他人操心，我们俩就不管了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们准备好武器和施术单元就行，三个小时以后会有人来推进工作的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然后咱们在沸区等他们事成来接头就行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么人？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"听到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"怪了......我明明锁好门了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"我听得很清楚，有人进来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"人，哪有人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"这么小的房间哪藏得下一个人，大概是只猫吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"说得对，的确有只不知死活的猫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"让我看看，是哪只小猫咪闯进了她不该来的地方？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂，能不能不要这么小气，让路过的流浪猫借宿一下也不行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者？你可真会挑时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都说了，我只是路过的流浪猫喔。不小心才跑到这里的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果赔给你们一个花瓶的话，二位能不能当作无事发生呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"......我没兴趣问你听到了什么，也不管你是不是真的只是误打误撞才来到这。既然被我们发现了，就别想活着离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"去死吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们难道没有听过一句话，“不能伤害猫，好运会跑掉”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"没射中？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"还有能力反击......这黑雾到底是什么东西——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，别这么着急嘛。不如再给你们猜一个谜语好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“为什么石头像烟花？”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"别想逃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逃到这，总可以避一会儿了吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......贵族的房间，总是有种让人想吐的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肩膀......那个凶巴巴的家伙，射得还挺准的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好，应该没伤到骨头......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（握住箭杆）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请问......这位小姐？您是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不许动！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘！别出声！我不想杀你，只是借你这躲一会儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最好配合一点，要是不老实，我就把这支箭——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"冷静一点，小姐，不要紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您......您看起来受伤了，您需要帮助吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你别过来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"源石技艺产生的黑烟弥漫在屋内，老人向后退了一步，却跌倒在地上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仆人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老爷？有事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（紧张）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我在写议案，天亮之前不要来打扰我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仆人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好的老爷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这位，女士......咳......咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我没猜错的话，您应该是感染者对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要紧张......我不会伤害您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"narration","text":"年迈的萨弗拉贵族突然捂住了心脏，发出了痛苦的声音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你怎么了？我只是用源石技艺吓唬你一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......这下麻烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来人啊！有人倒下了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唉，该走了......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仆人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了老爷？刚才那个女孩子的声音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仆人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"昂斯特老爷！你怎么了！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"现在怎么办？咱们为什么不冲进去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"你傻啊？你也不看看这屋子是什么人住的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"这是那个昂斯特议员的宅子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"议员？那些贵族老爷的家？在这种地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么还有议员的宅子修在靠近感染者社区的地方？而且这也太小了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"好了你闭嘴吧。咱们得想想别的办法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"她在那边！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"跑出来了？那还省事了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们两个......好烦啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"别想跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"追！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"她中了一箭，应该跑不远才对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"但要小心她的源石技艺。不确定有没有杀伤力，但是能迷惑感知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"她到底有什么本事——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"又平地起雾了？是她在施术！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"她躲进去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"“绿意火花”......这是酒吧？看着不太像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"这边的房屋构造应该都是一样的，这些老房子除了正门没有别的出口，她逃不了了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"慢着，先别急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"那个菲林的源石技艺很厉害，小心那股黑烟。想抓她太难了，要打到也不容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没那么多时间陪她耗着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"那些燃烧弹你还带着吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"你要把这儿烧了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"这地方房屋这么密集，你确定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"不用犹豫，感染者的死活没人在乎。就算事情闹大了，对我们也是障眼的好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"别管那么多了，动作快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"这事情不能有任何差错，不能留活口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"......明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳咳......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多了，撤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"*粗口*，就为这个矿石病垃圾，费老子一晚上的工夫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"听说感染者死后会化成灰炸开？我还从来没有亲眼见过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"别多事，快走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想要抓住猫猫......得再聪明一点......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听好了......才不是被你们逼入绝境的......这是我自己......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"narration","text":"1097年11月26日 9:27 A.M.\n刺痛。\n肺在痛，胃在痛，肝也在痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"普通的止痛药......已经没用了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"病痛缠身的菲林女孩透过废旧房屋的窗户看向天空。\n浓雾笼罩了卡拉顿城，甚至看不到太阳的光亮。\n从灰山地到多伦郡，从开夏郡再到卡拉顿。\n一路逃跑，一路漂泊，同伴一个接着一个逝去。\n走得越远，失去的越多。\n浮萍总有沉落之池。\n猫猫，已经累了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女巫姐姐，你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女巫姐姐，那是血吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然......已经到极限了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小敏，我给你一些东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"认得这些硬币的面值吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"认得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每天拿一个，可以去威纶奶奶那边换点吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有这个。"},{"type":"narration","text":"菲林女巫掏出一个黑色的帆布宽檐帽子和一枚精致的戒指。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唉，女巫的仪式......现在也没什么意义了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是巫女林的第一百一十三位女巫，夜烟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灰山地的先贤见证一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"见证一位新人的加入......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"见证一个新的灵魂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还记得你之前问我的那件事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你现在已经是个女巫了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗？我也可以使用源石技艺了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"认真听我说，你本来就可以使用源石技艺，你很有天分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是以后使用源石技艺，要好好用这个戒指，像我之前教你的那样，没有这个戒指，就不准使用源石技艺，明白吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，只允许对坏人使用源石技艺哦，还记得怎么区分坏人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记得！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好......"},{"type":"narration","text":"菲林女巫站了起来，晃晃悠悠地向门口走去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女巫姐姐？你要走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......我该走了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"1097年11月27日 3:47 A.M.\n卡拉顿城的边缘废弃城区，这个城市最安静的区域。\n数年前自然灾害席卷了卡拉顿城之后，这片年久失修的地块被迁移到了城市的边缘。\n摇摇欲坠的楼房与彻底损坏的地面结构，见证了卡拉顿的历史。\n站在废区的高楼上，远处是一望无际的荒地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果要挑一个葬身之地的话，这倒是个有趣的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早就料到了会有这一天，也不能说是“没想到会来得这么快”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"菲林女巫靠坐在墙角，闭上了眼睛。\n矿石病病灶的刺痛感已经逐渐淡去，身体也越来越沉重。\n回忆如同走马灯一样，浮现在她的脑海。\n曾经的女巫同伴们，那位慈祥的大女巫格兰特，维多利亚军人的火炮点燃巫女林的那个夜晚。\n在荒地与城市间漂泊，不得已以盗窃为生的日子，那些不公的迫害。\n已经不再重要了。\n一切就要结束了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"然而她的耳边，却传来了阵阵啜泣声。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么到最后关头，还有人打搅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种地方还有人啊。"},{"type":"narration","text":"追随着传到耳边的声音，夜烟来到了废楼的另一个区域。\n在她的眼前，有一个菲林女孩正颤颤巍巍地站在废弃高楼的窗边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（啜泣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对不起......对不起，妈妈......对不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已经......不知道该怎么办了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"带着无助与绝望的表情，菲林女孩在废弃建筑的边缘摇摇欲坠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你这样很危险哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你是谁......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是谁不重要哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过在你要跳下去之前，我得告诉你几件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跳下去的话，真的会摔得很难看哦，我实在是不推荐你做这种事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等明天你的朋友看到你的时候，他们会很痛苦吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......朋友......夏栎姐......"},{"type":"narration","text":"啜泣的女孩犹豫着，离开了窗边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就对啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我该怎么称呼你呢，小猫猫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......苏茜......苏茜·格里特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个名字挺好听的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫我夜烟就可以了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜烟......小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜烟小姐......这么晚了，为什么在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还要问你呢，这儿可是我专属的秘密据点，你是怎么发现的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算啦，我也可以特别允许可爱的猫猫来这里玩哦，但用来跳楼可不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......呜呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸，你哭什么呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......算了，想哭就哭吧，没人会听到，所以也不用憋着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正这里也没人——虽然这儿也没有酒，要是有酒就更好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我正好还有点时间，来聊聊吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么要干这种傻事呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......有一个许多年的梦想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个许多年的梦想？那听起来挺好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我为这个梦想努力了许多年......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得，那就是我生命的全部意义了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到前几天，一转眼，什么都没有了......都被别人毁掉了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至不知道为什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么都没剩下......全都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者的生命又能有几年......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被别人毁掉了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你想到的第一件事情就是毁灭自己？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是很奇怪嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊？你在说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你自己说的呀。你的人生意义，你美好的梦想都被别人毁掉了，那你在做什么呢？把最后剩下的一点东西也毁掉吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不是这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把手伸过来，让我看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，哎——你要干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有结晶......感染程度算不上重吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我也不太清楚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，干嘛敲我脑袋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不聪明的小猫就应该敲敲脑袋让她清醒过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了梦想活着......对于感染者来说真是奢侈的想法啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么多人浑浑噩噩地活着，混吃等死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“反正大家都活不久，目标和理想什么的，何必要活得那么累呢？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你选择了为一个梦想而活着，很了不起哦，像你这样的人可太少见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你看......你只要还活着，办法总会有的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的时间比你想的要多得多，不像......我跑题了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果就这么放弃了，那就太遗憾啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可是我又能做什么呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像你这么可爱的猫猫，朋友一定很多吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不去找你的朋友们聊一聊呢？一个人蹲在这里瞎想可是一点好处都没有哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果什么东西丢了，就找回来，被别人抢走了，就想办法抢回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就这么放弃了，可就什么都没有咯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些坏人会笑得更开心，这样对自己也不公平吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些毁掉你梦想的坏家伙，他们才应该被丢到楼下去，不是吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"年轻的菲林犹豫地看向窗边，她的脸上充斥着无奈。在这个破旧漆黑的废楼中，时间缓慢地流逝着。\n在一阵沉默与思考后，她长叹了一口气，露出了疲惫的笑容，似乎放下了一些精神上的重担。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说得对......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果还有什么难过的地方，那就大声喊出来吧，反正这里也没什么人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不用了......谢谢你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就对了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前大女巫说过，只要还能看到明天的太阳，一切就还都有希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少......还有......明......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，欸欸！夜烟小姐！你怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小心......别靠近我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜烟小姐！你怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜烟","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......快走......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事，身上怎么这么烫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"振作一点！醒醒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来人啊！救命！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜烟小姐......你坚持一下，我们，马上就到城区了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我要背不动你了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是说夜烟小姐太重了，一点也不重，是我力气太小了......"},{"type":"narration","text":"背上的女孩，气息越来越弱。\n她能感觉到，一个鲜活的生命正在淡去。\n一种潮湿且温暖的触感从背上传来，逐渐扩散。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么......这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......血？"},{"type":"narration","text":"暗红色的鲜血从少女的口鼻中渗出，滴落在地面上。\n她明白这代表着什么，每个感染者都明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要......不要......不要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜烟小姐......不要......求求你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"从五年前离开家乡起，她已经不止一次目睹过感染者的离去。\n伴随着每一次身边熟知的人消逝，她对死亡的感知也更加麻木。\n每个感染者都要面对这样的命运。\n但是这一次，不知道为什么，她不愿意承受目睹眼前生命消逝的痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"求求你！夜烟小姐......求求你......不要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坚持住......我们就快到......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她让背上的女孩平躺在地上，想要减少她的痛苦。\n她紧紧地握着眼前这位女孩的手，她尝试去擦拭对方脸上的血迹。\n她徒劳地努力着，她尝试阻止死亡的来临。\n然而在迫近的死亡面前，这一切都显得没有意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救命......救命啊！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是谁......求求你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帮帮我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帮帮我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"低声的哭喊穿过了空旷的夜空，回荡在无人的废弃街区。\n远处，一阵缓慢的脚步声传来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_328_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......苏茜小姐？你怎么在这里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
